# kin/child/face/paint_mask: the child's face paint: a band across the brow and down beside the eyes (the accent; the people's own paint)
# (KIN-CHILD, P2b wave 2; the child, STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role paint mask
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
z 3
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -1 -4
|nnnnnnnnnn
|n........n
|n........n
|n........n

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -6 -4
|nnnnnn
|n.....

view L key rest origin -1 -4
|nnnnnn
|.....n

